WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
I wanted to tell you that I made the decision to drop the candidacy of Silvio Alospenato.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:23.000
And I know, you will ask why and you will not understand the message, but all the prognostics show that Kirchnerism is first in the city and we cannot allow that.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.000
That's why I ask you to vote for Manuel Adorni this Sunday.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Although I recently had differences with President Milley,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
you know that I will always defend the Republic and the institutions.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:48.000
When you vote tomorrow, due to technical and time issues,

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
the list of Syrians will continue to appear on the screen.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.740
That's why this message. Let's all vote for the president's candidate

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:02.340
Milley and we will not allow that the kirchnerism win in the city of Buenos Aires.
